          "supports": "the alphabet table"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "field-legacy-ngc-key",
      "statement": "legacy-ngc-key: the legacy NGC key is 84 non-space characters with no prefix, used as the $oauthtoken registry password; its structure is tool-inferred (Context-anchored only; generic context covers NGC_API_KEY=. Nothing is authored for it either way.)",
      "evidenceClass": "unresolved",
      "temporality": "current",
      "observedAt": "2026-09-29",
      "sources": [
