      "statement": "boundary: a key glued to an identifier before the prefix ([A-Za-z0-9_-]) is not claimed (Handoff boundary decision, not a provider statement. The body class already contains _ and -, so a trailing byte extends the run and no trailing-glue twin exists.)",
